    <item>
      <title>Go Daily Question 197</title>
      <link>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_197/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 26 Feb 2025 01:01:24 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_197/</guid>
      <category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/godailyquestion/">GoDailyQuestion</category>
      <category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/golanguagebasics/">GoLanguageBasics</category>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Will the following code compile?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;package main&#xA;&#xA;import &amp;#34;fmt&amp;#34;&#xA;&#xA;func main() {&#xA;    m := make(map[string]int)&#xA;    m[&amp;#34;qcrao&amp;#34;] = 1&#xA;    fmt.Println(&amp;amp;m[&amp;#34;qcrao&amp;#34;])&#xA;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&lt;details&gt;&#xA;  &lt;summary&gt;🔑 Answer Analysis:&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;No.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;./prog.go:8:15: invalid operation: cannot take address of m[&amp;#34;qcrao&amp;#34;] (map index expression of type int)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://go.dev/play/p/4W5-rMuIiYI&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;external nofollow noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Run online&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;The address of a map element cannot be taken directly.&#xA;Once a map expands, the positions of keys and values change, and previously saved addresses become invalid.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;</description>
    </item>
